  "description": "With a 440 lb. total payload capacity, comfort-forward geometry, and 30-50 mile range, the Flyer Loop offers smooth, confident handling for hauling both kids and cargo. The 750W rear hub motor flattens hills, the suspension fork easily soaks\nup bumpy terrain, and the premium Magura 4-piston hydraulic disc brakes offer confidence-inspiring stopping power.\n\nThe Loop’s folding front stem simplifies storage (apartment, bike room, train, vehicle, garage, etc)., while integrated front and rear turn signals, full-coverage fenders, and sleek wire management enhance safety and style.\n\nThe Flyer™ Loop can accommodate up to two Thule Yepp Nexxt 2 seats, and for added convenience, the frame features a built-in storage compartment with an included weather-resistant storage bag – ideal for chargers or gear you need while on the go.",
